//! Database schema definitions generated by Diesel.
//!
//! This module contains the `diesel::table!` macros mapping Rust types to the PostgreSQL
//! schema defined in the `migrations` directory. It acts as the bridge between the database
//! tables and Diesel's strongly-typed query builder.

